	fi
fi
sound L7D.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I'll try again for another year.
text @[Tomoya]
text I see...
text @[Tomoya]
text So that's your decision?
sound L7E.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Yes. I've decided.
text Will Nagisa be okay at school without me around?
text She'll have to suffer yet another handicap.
text Will she end up standing paralyzed at the bottom of that hill again?
text Will she be okay without me there to push her?
text Will she be able to climb it?
text Will she be able to walk?
text ......
text But she fought so hard back then...
text And saw through what she wanted to...
text So I'm sure she'll be able to climb that hill...
text She'll be able to walk, and go forward.
text @[Tomoya]
text Nagisa.
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text I embrace her thin shoulders.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'll always be waiting for you, so...
text And then...
text @[Tomoya]
text Do your best.
text I give her my words of encouragement.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG23B"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG23B.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound L7F.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Okay. I will.
text Now, I don't want to stand still... I want to walk.
text I want to go as far as we can go.
text We'll travel up this endless hill...
